{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_01",
      "hash": "eb0270625db7e4cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_05",
      "hash": "eb0274625db7eb97",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你在训练宝可梦时，\\n有你自己的原则吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_06",
      "hash": "eb0275625db7ed4a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我的原则就是……\\n派出我的水属性宝可梦，\\r\\n痛扁痛扁……痛扁到底哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_07",
      "hash": "eb0276625db7eefd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了！就让我这世界级美少女\\n小霞来做你的对手吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_08",
      "hash": "eb0267625db7d580",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "去吧！\\n我的宝贝！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_02_01",
      "hash": "727c3d2a1a30cc28",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_02_06",
      "hash": "727c442a1a30d80d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_02",
      "hash": "eb0271625db7e67e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真没辙！\\c\\n作为你战胜我的证明，\\n蓝色徽章就送你了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8010_sys_01",
      "hash": "fa93f3e6a1687f4d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从小霞那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]蓝色徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_03",
      "hash": "eb0272625db7e831",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了蓝色徽章，\\n就算是别人送你的宝可梦，\\r\\n只要是等级在30以内，\\r\\n都会乖乖听话哦！\\c\\n……还有，这个是我\\n引以为豪的招式学习器！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8010_sys_02",
      "hash": "fa93f0e6a1687a34",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从小霞那里\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n“[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_04",
      "hash": "eb0273625db7e9e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式学习器29可以\\n让宝可梦学会“热水”！\\c\\n你要让生活在水里的宝可梦\\n学学这个招式哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_02_05",
      "hash": "727c412a1a30d2f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
